        "description": "**Breed:** White Cat Mix\n**Height:** 149 cm\n\nVanilla is quiet, calm and very stoic. She rarely expresses her emotions, making her a somewhat of a kuudere character, as opposed to her sister's energetic, playful personality. She loves her twin sister [Chocola](https://anilist.co/character/88787/Chocola), and will accompany her always due to her siscon-like relationship towards her.",
