    {
      "role": "MAIN",
      "node": {
        "id": 88787,
        "name": {
          "full": "Chocola",
          "native": "ショコラ",
          "alternative": []
        },
        "image": {
          "large": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b88787-grII9ZA6Nx1N.jpg"
        },
        "description": "**Breed:** Black Cat Mix\n**Height:** 152 cm\n\nChocola is a cheerful and energetic catgirl as [Kashou](https://anilist.co/character/130309/Minazuki-Kashou) himself describes her, 'happy-go-lucky.' She doesn't usually get upset, and even when she does, she often swings back to being as cheery as usual, though occasionally she can be genuinely sad about something. She is curious, and has a childlike outlook on things, which is fitting as she and [Vanilla](https://anilist.co/character/88788/Vanilla) are mentioned to be only 9 months old in human terms. She likes Kashou.",
        "gender": "Female",
        "age": null
