        },
        "description": "**Breed:** Maine Coon\n**Height:** 168 cm\n\nCoconut is the second youngest of the Minazuki catgirls. The others typically consider her to be cool, but Coconut yearns to instead be considered cute and doesn't seem to have much confidence in her body. She has low self-esteem due to her clumsiness and self-proclaimed lack of skills.",
