        },
        "description": "**Breed:** Scottish Fold\n**Height:** 150 cm\n\nThe third oldest catgirl in the Minazuki Familly. Cinnamon is typically shy and very cheerful. However, her somewhat active and perverted imagination causes her to interpret various everyday occurrences in a sexual manner and become aroused as a result. She seems rather shameless about this trait as she will do it in public or in front of customers of La Soleil.",
