        "description": "**Breed:** Munchkin\n**Height:** 142 cm\n\nThe eldest catgirl of the Minazuki Family. She is quite full of energy, but can be rude and has a knack for bad mouthing her younger sisters, despite supposedly being the most grown up. Even so, she cares for her family and sometimes worries for their well-beings.",
