        "description": "**Height:** 135 cm\n\nThe younger sister of Kashou Minazuki. She takes an almost mother-like pride in the catgirls she has trained. Despite her elegant demeanor, she has a gigantic brother complex which occasionally surfaces as love declarations for Kashou.",
