        },
        "description": "Kashou is very independent and knows how to take care of himself. Being focused on his self-sufficiency, he often isolates himself from others as much as he can.\n\nKashou is quite serious at times and always looks at reality. He isn't very sociable with others due to his independent demeanor. He'll occasionally avoid any opportunities to start a conversation. Apart from that, he's very nice and takes care of Chocola and Vanilla like little sisters.\n\nAs a descendant in a line of pastry chefs, Kashou likes to take pride in his cooking skills. He takes in a hobby of trying out new cooking methods to create the most delicious dishes. He treats every of his baking products with care and with great precision.",
